#. module: mail_bounce_report
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:mail_bounce_report.field_res_config_settings__mail_bounce_report_threshold
msgid ""
"A contact is flagged \"Above Threshold\" once its bounce counter reaches "
"this number (the test is >=, i.e. inclusive). The default of 10 is the same "
"limit Odoo's own mail code uses before it considers an address dead. "
"Changing it only changes the report."
msgstr ""

