#: model:ir.model.fields,help:mail_bounce_report.field_mail_bounce_report__partner_active
msgid "Unticked for archived contacts, which the report still lists."
msgstr ""

#. module: mail_bounce_report
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:mail_bounce_report.field_mail_bounce_report__has_email
msgid ""
"Unticked when the contact carries no usable email address. Such a contact "
"can still hold a bounce counter from an address that was later cleared, and "
"can never match a blacklist entry."
msgstr ""

#. module: mail_bounce_report
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:mail_bounce_report.field_mail_bounce_report__bounce_count
msgid ""
"Value of the standard res.partner \"Bounce\" counter (message_bounce). Odoo "
"increments it when a bounce is received for this address and resets it to "
"zero when the address answers."
msgstr ""

